==Battleground==
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16 seconds<sup>400f~480f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~32 seconds<sup>800f~960f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chun-Li (Enemy)|Chun-Li]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 9.33~12 seconds<sup>280f~360f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Chun-Li is only at 2% magnification and the peons are only at 100%.

